# Force LF line endings for tracked SQL schema files regardless of the
# checking-out platform's core.autocrlf setting. The schema-apply engine's
# fingerprint (scripts/handoff.js _computeSchemaFingerprint) hashes
# EOL/BOM-normalized content, but pinning the on-disk representation to LF
# here removes the platform-dependent checkout step from the equation
# entirely (Windows core.autocrlf=true previously produced CRLF working-tree
# copies of every *.sql file while CI checked them out as LF -- see cm#185
# S-8). Schema files are DDL text meant to run unmodified through psql/pg/
# node:sqlite clients; CRLF has no semantic meaning here.
*.sql text eol=lf
